WEBVTT

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.190
Yuki. Yuki, get up already.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.780
I know we're on vacation, but 
you're sleeping way too much.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.700
Mom says the weather's nice today,

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.100
so we should hang our futons outside.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:27.830
Come on, get...

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.500
Ow.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.470
Get up already.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.140
Yuta, you're so scary.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.760
It's your own fault you hit your head.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.720
Shut up.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:44.810
I wanted to carry on sleeping.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:49.820
<i>We've been living together 
since we were born.</i>

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.500
<i>A whole 17 years.</i>

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:25.060
Yuki, you don't have to keep hitting it.

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.600
No matter how much I hit it,
 all this dusty stuff...

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.360
keeps coming out.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:31.820
Those are the feathers inside.

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:35.350
If you hit it too much, 
you'll ruin the futon.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.270
Really?

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.180
We should get Kaname to do this.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:47.300
This kinda thing would let 
him release all his anger.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.440
Where are Mom and Dad?

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.270
They went out.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.740
But, what about breakfast?

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.090
It's already noon.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.450
I'm hungry.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.400
There's curry left over from yesterday.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.920
Heat it up.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.160
Me?

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.170
No, I will.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:07.630
Get dressed before you eat.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:09.500
You're still wearing your pajamas.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.330
Can't I just wear this?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.350
No.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:19.650
<i>Yuta's pretty anal about stuff.</i>

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.120
I'm finished.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.100
Take your dishes with you.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:49.520
Your pajamas.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:50.320
Huh?

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:53.160
Put them in the washing machine.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:56.800
And at least try to tidy that bookshelf.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.500
Where are you going?

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:01.970
Out.

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:04.510
If you're going out, 
pick up some light bulbs.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.920
The bathroom light's out.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:46.240
<i>If I lived on my own, I could pick 
out books at the bookstore at my leisure.</i>

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.090
<i>If I just sat here and did nothing,</i>

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:50.220
<i>no one would rush me.</i>

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.230
<i>Where should I go next?</i>

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.740
<b>Homa Ranger Show</b>

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.310
Senpai.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:14.310
Senpai, are you here to see 
the Homa Ranger show, too?

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.500
No, I'm...

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:23.320
Oh, good. I wasn't sure I'd have the guts
to go and watch it surrounded by little kids.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:29.010
Hello, everyone.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.370
Hello!

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.270
I can't hear you!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.840
Hello!

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:39.050
You certainly need courage 
to sit in the front row.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:42.340
I'm surprised to see you by yourself.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:46.140
I thought you always hung 
out with your gang.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.520
It's nice to go out by 
myself, once in a while.

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:50.280
Huh?

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.500
Even when I'm at home,

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:56.950
there's always someone else around.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:04.300
Oh, no! The evil Skull 
Squad has appeared!

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:07.760
Looks like they're trying to 
kidnap good boys and girls.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.640
What? Um...

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:18.510
A boy's been captured 
by the Skull Squad!

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:19.930
But, never fear!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:22.850
I'm sure the Homa Ranger 
will come rescue him.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:26.170
You'd better call the Homa Ranger!

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.650
Huh? S-Save...

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:31.410
Save me, Homa Ranger!

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:35.370
Let's all try it together.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.370
Homa Ranger!

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.630
What? Senpai?

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.630
<i>Light bulbs... light bulbs...</i>

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:46.180
Really?

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:47.700
We can have it?

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.830
Yeah.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.630
Hooray!

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.040
Thanks, Dad!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.030
I'm so happy!

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.390
<i>Until we got our bunk bed,</i>

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.810
<i>we slept side by side on the floor.</i>

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:05.980
<i>That huge bed excited us 
more than any toy ever could.</i>

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.050
Should we climb up there?

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:10.220
Yeah.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:16.830
Wow, this is amazing.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.220
Yeah, really amazing.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:21.350
Don't do that, Yuki.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.240
We're gonna sleep way up here.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.780
I'm gonna sleep on top.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.260
But I want to be on top.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:38.560
Shoot.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.940
Okay, I'm on top.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.660
You're on the bottom.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.360
Best of five.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.180
What?

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:48.160
Please! Come on.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:48.980
Fine.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.280
Shoot.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.440
Shoot.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.780
Okay, now I'm really on top.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:59.830
Mom, can I put out my futon yet?

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:03.030
Not fair! I wanna be on top.

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:06.070
You can't. You lost at rock, paper, scissors.

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:09.210
You're so mean. You're mean, Yuta.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.930
Yuki, I'm turning out the light.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.430
Yuki.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:42.080
Hooray! Hooray!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.130
Yuta, when they bought us 
that bunk bed, I wonder if...

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.640
Yuki, take the futons to our bedroom.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.140
Oh, right.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.850
<i>He went out.</i>

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.520
This must be it.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.790
Yuta, I bought a light bulb...

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:35.130
I can't breathe, Yuki-kun.

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:40.230
This must be it.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.000
This must be what they mean 
by the smell of sunshine.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.660
It's kinda relaxing.

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.270
What is it, Yuki?

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:17.770
What's wrong?

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.680
I'm gonna sleep here.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.850
What?

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:22.990
Good night.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.430
Just for tonight.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.420
I don't have enough room.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.190
Yuki, promise me you'll sleep 
on the bottom bunk tomorrow.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.440
Yuta, you still smell of shampoo.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.870
Are you listening?

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.540
We're not babies anymore.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.200
You have to learn to sleep by yourself.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:42.370
That's not it.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.380
I just wanted to sleep on top, too.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.920
It's the last day of the year.{F: is there a real name for this? I'm guessing it's not New Year's Eve}

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.020
I'm sure a lot of families out there...

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:02.930
are busy cleaning their homes.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.520
If you have time to watch TV,

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.400
I'm also really busy at this time of year,

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.540
go change the light bulb in the bedroom.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:07.680
so I'd appreciate any sort of help.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:07.680
Okay, okay.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.630
Yuta-kun and Yuki-kun,
 do you have enough rags?

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.690
Yeah.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.100
Where's the new detergent?

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:19.330
Oh, right. We have to go buy some.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:36.180
This has been here for a while.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.350
Didn't you draw this?

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:44.330
Yuki, help me clean.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.330
I won't be able to do 
it all today otherwise.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.500
I'm doing it.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:51.240
I'm deciding what to keep 
and what to throw out.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:54.550
You say that, but you 
haven't made any progress.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.580
<i>We've been together since we were born,{F: is this said or a thought? Not sure?}</i>

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:03.280
<i>and we do the same 
thing every New Year's Eve.</i>

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:07.230
Come on, grab a rag.

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:09.540
Yuki.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:23.520
Oh, Yuta.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.610
Are we gonna have New Year's soba today?

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.100
Yuta, you're dripping all over!

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.750
The water! My manga!

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.850
Huh? Oh, sorry.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.470
What are you doing?

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:39.870
It'll be fine. It's not that much.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:42.440
This is terrible.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.270
You'd better pay me for this stuff.

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:47.430
You'd better pay me back for this, Yuta.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.580
Pay you?

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:56.290
You should've done the cleaning yourself.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.990
I told you to do it, 
but you refused.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:01.960
You're gonna get mad 
at me instead of apologizing?

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:04.900
I apologized for the manga.

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:06.480
No, you didn't.

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:09.310
You don't think you did anything wrong.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:14.210
You always ignore me when 
I tell you to do things.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:16.420
That's because you always go on and on...

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:18.690
about every little thing.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.360
Then, do it before I have 
to tell you to do it.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:29.040
Yuta-kun, Yuki-kun,
 can one of you clean the tub?

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.230
The tub...

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:37.150
Yuta-kun, where's Yuki-kun going?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.250
I don't know.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.090
It's your fault.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:46.220
I haven't explained the details yet.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.830
I don't have to hear them to know.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:50.420
I'm sure you made Yuta mad...

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:52.980
because you wouldn't 
help him clean, right?

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:56.190
No, it's Yuta's fault.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.920
He didn't wring out his rag enough.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.450
Are you saying you did help?

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.530
I really did.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.740
I was deciding which issues 
of Animajor to keep.

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.780
I knew you weren't helping him clean.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.730
You don't usually fight, 
but I'm not surprised...

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:16.100
you're arguing over something so stupid.

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:19.000
Go home. I'm not getting involved.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.880
No. I'll live here from now on.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.300
What are you, a kid?

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:27.470
Oh? I don't mind you living here with us.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.740
Really, Mom?

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.500
Of course not!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.010
And don't call her Mom!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.350
Oh, Kaname-kun, you're so cold.

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:39.100
I hope someone takes me away from you,

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:42.520
so you can finally realize 
how important I am.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.350
Don't give me that.

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:46.430
You're the one who needs to 
realize how ridiculous it is...

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:48.400
to use your son's friends 
to make me feel bad.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:51.700
I'm a lot nicer than Kaname, ma'am.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:55.450
Don't make it sound like you're 
having an affair with my mom!

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.130
Go home already!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.160
No.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:02.060
You're just making this 
harder on yourself!

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.600
Seriously, go home!

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.070
Hey, stop it.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:14.970
Wait a minute. Don't call him.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.790
I mean it, don't.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.480
Hello, Yuta? It's me.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.860
Your idiot brother just 
showed up at my house.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.460
Can you take him home?

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:26.800
He's getting in our way.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:31.610
What? You, too?

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.330
It's not like I don't understand,

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:36.210
but don't stick me in the middle...

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.770
Hey, wait! Hey!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.230
What did Yuta say?

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.210
He said you don't have to come home.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.630
What are you going to do?

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.340
Yuta's really mad.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:58.100
Come on, just go home and apologize.

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.040
Okay, fine.

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.310
I'll go get a change of clothes.

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.610
Apologize!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:13.410
Yuta-kun, can you 
take out the garbage?

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:15.490
Sure.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:36.480
<i>He thinks I'll forgive him, 
no matter what he does.</i>

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:41.300
<i>It's always been that way. I always...</i>

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.340
That's right. We...

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:57.090
How long are you going to stay here?

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.510
Go home already!

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.780
No.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:05.330
Please don't ask me to do anything.
 Just let me stay here.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:06.320
I already heard your story.

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.800
You had a stupid argument.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:10.030
I won't ask you about...

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:12.720
your relationship with 
your mother, either.

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.390
Why not?! Just ask!

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:18.640
She's just a normal mother 
and I'm just a normal son!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.420
If you wait, it'll only 
make it harder to apologize.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.970
Is that the neighborhood circular?

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:39.180
As a new member of the 
Tsukahara household,

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.800
I should go introduce myself.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:41.970
Hey!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:48.980
Yuta.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.400
What are you doing?

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:54.470
Everyone's busy on New Year's 
Eve. If you stay too late,

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.110
you'll just get in their way.

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:03.220
Let's go.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:06.530
Your coat.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.630
Yuki-kun, you're going home?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.780
After everything you said,

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.780
Sorry for bothering you.

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:18.680
you still came to get him.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:19.720
That's why Yuki—

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:20.920
Just for today.

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:21.550
Huh?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:29.730
I'm going easy on him, just for today.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.580
Yuta, what's wrong?

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:54.980
Dad's plate.

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.920
What am I going to do?

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:10.690
Yuki?

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.480
Are you sure about this?

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:21.190
I'm sure. It'll be fine.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.490
It'll be our secret.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.410
That should do it.

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:33.290
Now that I've protected you,
 I'm an accomplice to the crime.

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:40.050
Even if we're found out, 
we'll both get in trouble.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.670
So, it'll be okay.

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:44.830
It'll be okay.

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.690
Um, Yu—

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:02.800
You headbutted me.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:06.470
I see. Are you really 
that mad, Yuki-kun?

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:10.040
No, I just slipped.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.770
It's fine.

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:14.900
I'm sure you're really peeved 
at your brother, aren't you?

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:19.440
I'm not mad. Honestly, I just slipped.

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.450
There's ice over here.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:23.110
I slipped on this and...

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.550
Look, Yuta. Look at it.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.400
Yuta.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:35.670
Sorry.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:41.670
Huh? Did we have a plate like this?

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:46.820
I don't know what happened, 
but it's not a big deal.

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:57.220
There's only a few 
minutes left of this year.

00:21:57.220 --> 00:21:59.630
A lot of things have happened this year.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.830
I wonder what next year will hold.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:03.340
Yuta-kun and Yuki-kun, here's more soba.

00:22:03.950 --> 00:22:05.800
Honey, come quick.

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:10.250
There's no Shichimi spice left.

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:13.060
What? Isn't there some more 
in the refrigerator?

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:17.740
Five, four, three, two, one...

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:18.610
That's odd. Did I put it in the cupboard?

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:20.310
<b>Shichimi Spice</b>

00:22:18.610 --> 00:22:20.310
There isn't any.

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:23.090
Happy New Year.

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:24.960
That's weird. I thought I put it in there.

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:24.570
Well, that's that.

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:26.300
Have a happy new year.

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:28.820
It's not there. We never put it there.

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:30.710
Don't we?

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:31.870
You, too.

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:33.180
Where could it have gone?

00:22:33.180 --> 00:22:35.910
I only bought it today.

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:42.610
In The Steam

00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:20.450
The Hem of the Sky
